 "title": "EXEC PARM= and a JOB resubmitted with RESTART=stepname",
 "category": "jcl",
 "issue": 4891,
 "shapes": [
  "BDLD BDLDRST.jcl: JOB statement carries RESTART=LOAD020; SORT010 precedes the restart step and is not executed by the restart",
  "BDLD BDLDRST.jcl: RPT030 EXEC PGM=BDLDRPT,PARM=MONTHLY"
 ],
 "asserts": "PARM= is the jcl_steps parm of its step (the text passed to the program). RESTART= on the JOB statement is the restart of every jcl_steps fact in that job: the named step is where execution resumes, the steps before it are not run.",
